Changes made in Fluxie
----------------------
  - Renamed the app to "Fluxie" (applicationId and namespace
    com.fluxie.browser, app label "Fluxie").
  - Moved Kotlin sources from com.sileneer.hydrogenbrowser to
    com.fluxie.browser and renamed the HydrogenDatabase, HydrogenNavGraph
    and HydrogenBrowserTheme symbols to FluxieDatabase, FluxieNavGraph
    and FluxieTheme.

